settings.

To set a value directly instead (without action staging in a recording),
use \code{\link[=pz_set_value]{pz_set_value()}}, \code{\link[=pz_set_files]{pz_set_files()}}, or \code{\link[=pz_set_shiny_input]{pz_set_shiny_input()}}.
